  "description": "・A Bullet Hell STG with a Literally “Diagonal” Evolution!\nThis is an original bullet-hell STG!\nIn this game, you can freely move around during stages!\nSet in a Japanese-style townscape, girls clash in fierce battles with bullet barrages and close-range attacks.\nBy using melee attacks, you can erase enemy bullets, and with the points you earn, purchase items and upgrades—so even players who struggle with bullet hell can feel at ease (probably).\nGo wild with powerful weapons earned through multiple playthroughs, or if you’re confident in your skills, experience the thrill of dodging everything with pure technique!\n\n・Unique Weapons with Personality\nDefeat bosses in rematches and earn original weapons as rewards.\nEach boss provides weapons with different special effects and stats, such as attack power and charge speed, with randomized values.\nThe upper and lower limits of these random stats can be checked in the in-game 「りーどみー」 section.",
